      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e196f6094a614285620b455bb001d692054c8541a5c5d1e2a331c122dcdddb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19857ded45e66cbe28e8e55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f9118eb7dcc351f08832b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要成为第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caaea7721b84585ce03f0d596f3759be19b08dea8cc15e9771866b5e4ee574ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d7c29461ef8415b88f46948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姑且向你道一句感谢吧。……谢啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a450e5aae22c8676c5511315e594e624f5c02f98cceca60fe91ab7cd30560e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8569dd15996a892d2b2c76af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很好！ 就请好好期待，\r\n我出色的表现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "132fdf25c06c4cb46377067ddb1c62fc331f8a91058f6ed15e4246eee3ced249",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b477045156bcb8ceb7b542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标除了第一之外别无他物！\r\n我一定会赢下比赛的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5f45ceb5924a853d51709e80232cde04a1ee942d4cc7b24af1208b31caadfd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4444247be6f08d4beac4b7b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姑且向你道一句感谢吧。…谢啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a4fe3d7a7668ef383a052f953b50cc1b820a2ed3b8dcdc7abfe98bfedf70ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99dd4487b2bb6fc524d5d504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってやるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f6a1ab179067e9499a193dffc6530de02df46fd3ebe0bfeddf620044ffce17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f78d7f64629d4659a44f867c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不甘心啊……下次一定要第一个到达终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f04ad844e48e3694689a5fa40cca7974b9c14029a1a1adbc7a61cb04a6d4b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3168b237f90e7117a042bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然是第三名……！？下次一定要赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5ba468809f33519b43b525b98ecd86a207f36fab55ca03cf5eb19643a74f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f9b75486a798364911606a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……！？勉强入着什么的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "883fa7f08ed05bc7976017f96a0d38a828d4d217517336fcc407cc9e0af2262e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eaa279696cf99bbf1216057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行……必须变得更强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1e7bffdb30ff781510ed012f2dad1b6511a0f4b3e66c6fc78b2adde503fe8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2ff5db87ec7fdfdbe2a05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪果然我是……第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c91dcfcf212b7e513005c1c90eb05be010737a042fba1a7842560e6428d0504",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c0b43b204302e61159af7bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的跑姿……都有好好注视着吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7144dbeee077184a32fe962ecfb4d6bfbe0a1cb19fa21b0d4b809268bc212e47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1f453915396758321f1597",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的愿望……无论何时都是第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8eb9913a3db10a4c3ca0c82b86bcffbdbc65f6e73e227acf1340e4e7e5e529",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284d3631faaf8de226b1999e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你刚刚有仔细看吧……我的跑姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef96ddc87614b3a0de3ebfc7598fad52c2e3ee1ed5fd212d9c9a8b40b92d88d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48cfcdf2f884e6d3e6260f12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c342a92fed379f7d88b58847a863af10ec3a875ba605350a5e87558b24909fd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54b66bb9267946684190b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优雅地……获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5936e16e6080642644cdccc9e0929f64aaaf1839bd7ab876c17faa78f59cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015a94daa14681f2f3b73ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能当上官方大使我是很高兴，\r\n但要跟她一起当啊……真是的，\r\n想也知道她铁定会给我添麻烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8840d5a37fdf7dc85f601b56b51d3f86e1cb6bb15cf599ced372d04f368a8963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19953753efb53a9b21743ec0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真期待大家一起出去玩♪\r\n那家伙得意忘形地拟定了很乱来的\r\n行程，所以我先调整过啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb266ecad075c7ba519033c8ab86ee8936b3b14a63581db05f24afe4723be6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e5c963043a5c5b88a11251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在妈妈眼里，\r\n是个没用的孩子吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "100c6ec82d93890c94cd03617c2bf5e91c2c2a736ef4a6382aa3833be9a0b4f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2e8ae3ed8a664e98bcd0bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！\r\n根本完全没照我的计划发展！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c27941da8b36050dcdf2cb6ab1753ae7fc12b31645532c1d608fe6894d57de5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3c6dcb196593e8372b845d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在所需要的东西，\r\n说不定，\r\n真的就在这里了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40ad35c9ff8f264893d525a25732fcdcd118e0b7455ffcbe3e34bcbe9792ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3c42f51b23f6ceeeb28010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优雅地……获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5936e16e6080642644cdccc9e0929f64aaaf1839bd7ab876c17faa78f59cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43410060db7052f2a8d23056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能让妈妈感到开心真是太好了。\r\n……早知道就该拍张照才对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f4eebf2867cbe48051d318579705e21c0b85ff34e782547070480c9fc6bbbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3c1d42472b61267f6b58b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6247156a9a0b76356e0136e0e3195416fc33993157dc9ec53abcfdb62b2b2785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b54a8dd962a7270e35a61888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要比谁都更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3977003147929b8de9f4cb49ecbfd66a31e6de60912f261171135a627a4e9a2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4bc0e66edcd8e76822b4e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到就火大、心生烦躁，\r\n但又无法不去在意……\r\n所以，她才会是我的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb54251f88211f7fe0a7e305ab9cfb766e2f0dd8c3f90aefafb96ca5a47c279",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c895ac9405fd19fddfdde7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将在冰冷的黑暗之中，\r\n把最闪耀的光芒……赠送给你！\r\n……很温暖吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88a6780a7bed4665014933803915077f7250e9e3696021f6a4e4986715b1d5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40004"
      ]
    }
  ]
